{
  "story_id": "swan-house",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 327288,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "On the ninth day, one of the adult swans came close.",
      "start_ms": 2245,
      "end_ms": 5645
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Elin was sitting on the dock reading in the afternoon.",
      "start_ms": 5645,
      "end_ms": 9172
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The swans had never come to the dock — never, not once in Elin's whole life — because Mummi had a rule that no one was to feed them or approach them.",
      "start_ms": 9172,
      "end_ms": 18794
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "\"They are wild,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 18794,
      "end_ms": 20526
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "\"If we feed them they change.",
      "start_ms": 20526,
      "end_ms": 22450
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "We do not want them to change.\"",
      "start_ms": 22450,
      "end_ms": 24567
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "But that afternoon, one of the adults — Elin thought it might be the female, though it was hard to tell — swam over to the dock.",
      "start_ms": 24567,
      "end_ms": 32841
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Slowly.",
      "start_ms": 32841,
      "end_ms": 33354
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Deliberately.",
      "start_ms": 33354,
      "end_ms": 34252
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "She came within maybe two meters.",
      "start_ms": 34252,
      "end_ms": 36433
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "She stopped.",
      "start_ms": 36433,
      "end_ms": 37267
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "She sat on the water.",
      "start_ms": 37267,
      "end_ms": 38678
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "She looked at Elin.",
      "start_ms": 38678,
      "end_ms": 39961
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Elin held her breath.",
      "start_ms": 39961,
      "end_ms": 41372
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "She had never been this close to a swan before.",
      "start_ms": 41372,
      "end_ms": 44451
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "The swan was much bigger up close than she had realized.",
      "start_ms": 44451,
      "end_ms": 48107
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Her yellow-and-black beak was as long as Elin's hand.",
      "start_ms": 48107,
      "end_ms": 51571
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Her eye was very black.",
      "start_ms": 51571,
      "end_ms": 53111
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Very steady.",
      "start_ms": 53111,
      "end_ms": 54009
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Elin did not move.",
      "start_ms": 54009,
      "end_ms": 55227
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "She said, very quietly, \"Hello.\" The swan tilted her head very slightly.",
      "start_ms": 55227,
      "end_ms": 59910
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "She stayed.",
      "start_ms": 59910,
      "end_ms": 60679
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "For maybe five minutes she stayed there — sitting on the water, looking at Elin, not eating, not swimming away.",
      "start_ms": 60679,
      "end_ms": 67863
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Then, slowly, she turned and swam back to her family.",
      "start_ms": 67863,
      "end_ms": 71327
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Elin sat on the dock for a long time after that.",
      "start_ms": 71327,
      "end_ms": 74470
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Then she went inside and she told Mummi.",
      "start_ms": 74470,
      "end_ms": 77164
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Mummi was cutting mushrooms at the table.",
      "start_ms": 77164,
      "end_ms": 79858
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "She looked up.",
      "start_ms": 79858,
      "end_ms": 80820
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "She was quiet for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 80820,
      "end_ms": 82616
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Then she said, \"Well.\" She kept cutting mushrooms.",
      "start_ms": 82616,
      "end_ms": 85888
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "\"That has never happened before, in all the years,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 85888,
      "end_ms": 89865
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "\"They have never come close.\" She looked up at Elin.",
      "start_ms": 89865,
      "end_ms": 93264
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Her face was hard to read.",
      "start_ms": 93264,
      "end_ms": 94996
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "She said, \"What did you think, Elin.",
      "start_ms": 94996,
      "end_ms": 97369
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "What did it feel like.\" Elin said, \"It felt like — she wanted to see me.",
      "start_ms": 97369,
      "end_ms": 102052
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Not because she wanted food.",
      "start_ms": 102052,
      "end_ms": 103912
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "She was looking at me.",
      "start_ms": 103912,
      "end_ms": 105387
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Really looking.\" Mummi nodded slowly.",
      "start_ms": 105387,
      "end_ms": 107825
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "\"Yes,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 107825,
      "end_ms": 108915
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "\"That is what it would look like.\"",
      "start_ms": 108915,
      "end_ms": 111096
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "The swan came back the next day.",
      "start_ms": 111096,
      "end_ms": 113653
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "And the day after.",
      "start_ms": 113653,
      "end_ms": 115126
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Both times in the afternoon.",
      "start_ms": 115126,
      "end_ms": 117373
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Both times she just sat and looked at Elin for a few minutes and then went back to her family.",
      "start_ms": 117373,
      "end_ms": 124736
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Elin started to look forward to it.",
      "start_ms": 124736,
      "end_ms": 127526
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "She stopped reading during those afternoon hours — she just sat on the dock and waited.",
      "start_ms": 127526,
      "end_ms": 134345
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "And the swan came.",
      "start_ms": 134345,
      "end_ms": 135818
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Always the same one.",
      "start_ms": 135818,
      "end_ms": 137445
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Always alone.",
      "start_ms": 137445,
      "end_ms": 138608
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "On the fourth day of this, Elin worked up the courage to speak more.",
      "start_ms": 138608,
      "end_ms": 143955
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "She was quiet at first.",
      "start_ms": 143955,
      "end_ms": 145815
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "She said, \"Hello.",
      "start_ms": 145815,
      "end_ms": 147210
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I don't know if you can understand me.",
      "start_ms": 147210,
      "end_ms": 150232
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "But hello.\" The swan looked.",
      "start_ms": 150232,
      "end_ms": 152480
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "\"My name is Elin.",
      "start_ms": 152480,
      "end_ms": 153875
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "I am ten.",
      "start_ms": 153875,
      "end_ms": 154650
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I am here with Mummi.\" The swan looked.",
      "start_ms": 154650,
      "end_ms": 157750
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "\"Are you — I don't know.",
      "start_ms": 157750,
      "end_ms": 159687
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Mummi says sometimes swans are people who have gone quiet.",
      "start_ms": 159687,
      "end_ms": 164260
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Is that true.\" The swan did not do anything special.",
      "start_ms": 164260,
      "end_ms": 168367
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "She sat.",
      "start_ms": 168367,
      "end_ms": 169064
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "She watched.",
      "start_ms": 169064,
      "end_ms": 170072
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Then she turned around and swam back to her family.",
      "start_ms": 170072,
      "end_ms": 174179
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "That evening after supper, Elin asked Mummi more about the story.",
      "start_ms": 174179,
      "end_ms": 179294
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Really asked, not the way she had asked when she was little.",
      "start_ms": 179294,
      "end_ms": 184022
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "\"Mummi.",
      "start_ms": 184022,
      "end_ms": 184642
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "When you say people who have gone quiet — what does that mean.",
      "start_ms": 184642,
      "end_ms": 189524
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Do you mean the swans are actually people.",
      "start_ms": 189524,
      "end_ms": 192856
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Or do you mean something else.\" Mummi thought for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 192856,
      "end_ms": 197739
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "She was drying dishes.",
      "start_ms": 197739,
      "end_ms": 199521
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Finally she said, \"I do not know exactly what my grandmother meant.",
      "start_ms": 199521,
      "end_ms": 204791
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "She was a very serious woman.",
      "start_ms": 204791,
      "end_ms": 207116
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "She did not lie.",
      "start_ms": 207116,
      "end_ms": 208433
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "She did not tell stories to entertain children.",
      "start_ms": 208433,
      "end_ms": 212153
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "She said what she believed.",
      "start_ms": 212153,
      "end_ms": 214323
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "And she said, sometimes, when a person has had something so heavy they cannot carry it anymore, and they cannot say it, they go quiet in a way that goes very deep.",
      "start_ms": 214323,
      "end_ms": 227033
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Deeper than talking.",
      "start_ms": 227033,
      "end_ms": 228660
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "And when they are that quiet, something in the world lets them rest.",
      "start_ms": 228660,
      "end_ms": 234008
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "And they can be a bird, for a while.",
      "start_ms": 234008,
      "end_ms": 236875
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Or a fish, or a tree.",
      "start_ms": 236875,
      "end_ms": 238580
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "And then when they are ready, they can come back.",
      "start_ms": 238580,
      "end_ms": 242455
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Some people never come back.",
      "start_ms": 242455,
      "end_ms": 244703
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Some do.\"",
      "start_ms": 244703,
      "end_ms": 245400
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "\"Mummi,\" said Elin.",
      "start_ms": 245400,
      "end_ms": 246715
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "\"Do you believe it.",
      "start_ms": 246715,
      "end_ms": 248031
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Really.\" Mummi looked at her.",
      "start_ms": 248031,
      "end_ms": 250004
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "She said, \"I believe there are things about the world that we cannot explain.",
      "start_ms": 250004,
      "end_ms": 255134
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "I believe that.",
      "start_ms": 255134,
      "end_ms": 256187
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "And I know that there has been a family of swans on this lake as long as anyone in my family can remember.",
      "start_ms": 256187,
      "end_ms": 263225
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "I do not have a better explanation.",
      "start_ms": 263225,
      "end_ms": 265592
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "So — yes.",
      "start_ms": 265592,
      "end_ms": 266250
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "I believe it in my own way.",
      "start_ms": 266250,
      "end_ms": 268092
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "That may not be the same as believing it.",
      "start_ms": 268092,
      "end_ms": 270854
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "But it is close enough for me.\"",
      "start_ms": 270854,
      "end_ms": 273025
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "In the fourth week of Elin's visit, a big storm came.",
      "start_ms": 273025,
      "end_ms": 276577
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "It came suddenly, in the afternoon — the sky went from pale blue to almost black in about half an hour, and the wind picked up hard, and the rain came down heavy and cold.",
      "start_ms": 276577,
      "end_ms": 287890
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Elin and Mummi were inside.",
      "start_ms": 287890,
      "end_ms": 289731
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "The lake, which had been glass-still all summer, was suddenly full of whitecaps.",
      "start_ms": 289731,
      "end_ms": 295059
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Elin looked out the window.",
      "start_ms": 295059,
      "end_ms": 296901
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "She could just barely see the swans, huddled together at the far end of the lake, near a reed bed.",
      "start_ms": 296901,
      "end_ms": 303478
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "The storm lasted three hours.",
      "start_ms": 303478,
      "end_ms": 305451
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "By dusk, when it was over, the lake was calming down.",
      "start_ms": 305451,
      "end_ms": 309003
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Elin went out on the dock immediately.",
      "start_ms": 309003,
      "end_ms": 311568
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "She looked.",
      "start_ms": 311568,
      "end_ms": 312357
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "She counted.",
      "start_ms": 312357,
      "end_ms": 313212
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "One, two, three.",
      "start_ms": 313212,
      "end_ms": 314331
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Three white shapes near the reed bed.",
      "start_ms": 314331,
      "end_ms": 316830
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Only three.",
      "start_ms": 316830,
      "end_ms": 317619
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Two adults and one cygnet.",
      "start_ms": 317619,
      "end_ms": 319395
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Where the second cygnet had been, there was nothing.",
      "start_ms": 319395,
      "end_ms": 322881
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "She looked and looked.",
      "start_ms": 322881,
      "end_ms": 324394
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "She could not find it.",
      "start_ms": 324394,
      "end_ms": 325907
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "She ran to get Mummi.",
      "start_ms": 325907,
      "end_ms": 327288
    }
  ]
}